    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28698" root="عرض" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرَضَّى</span></b> , with fet-h to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ر</span>; (O;) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرِضَّى</span>,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِمِكَّى</span>; (K;) <i>Briskness, liveliness,</i> or <i>sprightliness.</i> (IAar, O, K. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرَضْنَةٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
[app. for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذُو عِرَضَّى</span>] meaning also <i>Brisk, lively,</i>
or <i>sprightly.</i> (TA. [See, again, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرَضْنَةٌ</span>.])

